{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》參賽者俞可程因捲入假單身風波，其香港版約會戲份遭製作組全數刪走。近日網上平台意外流出她與Zico在主題樂園約會未刪剪足本片段，瞬間引爆中港兩地粉絲熱烈討論。盤點內地版約會片段的「3大場面」，還原這段充滿話題性、令網民睇到火滾的完整約會！場面一：俞可程主題樂園狂放電 惹來...</p>\n<p>TVB戀愛綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》參賽者俞可程因捲入假單身風波，其香港版約會戲份遭製作組全數刪走。近日網上平台意外流出她與Zico在主題樂園約會未刪剪足本片段，瞬間引爆中港兩地粉絲熱烈討論。盤點內地版約會片段的「3大場面」，還原這段充滿話題性、令網民睇到火滾的完整約會！</p>\n<h2>場面一：俞可程主題樂園狂放電 惹來內地彈幕嘲諷</h2>\n<p>除了纜車談心，片段亦保留了二人在主題樂園戶外漫步的互動場面。畫面中可見Zico相當有風度地為Kanis沿途講解及指引方向，而Kanis亦全程表現雀躍。不過，內地網民似乎早已看穿一切，在Zico興致勃勃地與女方互動時，內地版本的畫面上竟無情地打出「好慘的男人」五隻大字！這句字幕猶如「神預言」般精準總結了Zico在節目中被蒙在鼓裡的命運，引發大批香港網民共鳴，紛紛戥男方感到不值。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541089660741751_14169068106b03cbd17d612.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541089660741751_14169068106b03cbd17d612.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541090342020149_10736006376b03cbd7dabc0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.11.37.png/3098x1620_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541090342020149_10736006376b03cbd7dabc0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541091239655474_4699830016b03cbe0d1f0c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.59.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541091239655474_4699830016b03cbe0d1f0c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795410919124349_18414845016b03cbe80a2c0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.10.22.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795410919124349_18414845016b03cbe80a2c0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541092722361871_4559846366b03cbf032b38.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.37.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541092722361871_4559846366b03cbf032b38.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>仲拖手！（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>場面二：俞可程幕後受訪大談熊貓水母 慘遭瘋狂狙擊</h2>\n<p>除了戶外約會互動，未刪剪版本同時播出俞可程單獨幕後訪問片段。畫面可見她坐在高腳椅上接受訪問，期間手舞足蹈大談樂園內動物，配合畫面上出現「熊貓」、「水母」、「企鵝」等字眼。大批知悉假單身風波真相網民狠批她不停玩頭髮及刻意改變聲線，並紛紛留言直指「好鬼作狀」、「聽返平時啲聲差好遠，呢把聲勁姣」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541093525492403_5216383366b03cbf7af479.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.09.54.png/2652x1754_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541093525492403_5216383366b03cbf7af479.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541094506717080_12687986326b03cc01ad92c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午1.10.01.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541094506717080_12687986326b03cc01ad92c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541095335652208_4351593926b03cc09e7d2d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.14.15.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541095335652208_4351593926b03cc09e7d2d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>場面三：癡情Zico將迷你小貓公仔珍藏店舖惹人痛心</h2>\n<p>在流出的內地版片段中，其中一幕最令網民深刻的，是Kanis與Zico在纜車上的獨處時光。兩人在纜車內並肩而坐，女方身穿淺藍色吊帶裙展現招牌甜美笑容，氣氛看似相當融洽。其後，兩人更互送禮物，畫面可見Kanis滿面笑容，而Zico則開心手持一隻由Kanis送贈的迷你小貓公仔。   最令網民感到崩潰的是，有眼利粉絲發現Zico對這份節目中的禮物極為重視，現實中竟將這隻小貓公仔擺放在自己經營的店舖「Iceyaki」內作珍藏展示！<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541096228161115_940301856b03cc12eb251.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 上午11.15.32.png/2544x1564_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179541096228161115_940301856b03cc12eb251.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民力撐香港製作組大義滅親刪走虐心畫面</h2>\n<p>這段絕密片段在網上瘋傳後，網民對俞可程造作表現給予一面倒負面評價，並紛紛對男方遭遇感到痛心。大批粉絲留言痛斥「仲要放喺舖頭珍而重之？！好虐心喎！」以及「Zico放喺iceyaki嘅其中一隻貓係kanis送嘅？？？？！！」。不少觀眾看完足本版後，強烈支持電視台製作組神剪輯決策，直指幸好香港版本將這些畫面全數刪走。</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:30:22.804395+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1457,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T07:05:19.269469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:23:57.852186+00:00","content_hash":"a211af967e5d6af236aba19352d4b8074da63a12a9f76a554cdad9f72140944a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}